{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Create a draft using sop (documentation only, requires procedure), team_commitments (project and Slack), request_intake or document_review (private submitted run input). Choose project, personal, team with explicit member usernames, or tenant audience. Optional execution_plan supports up to eight dependency-checked draft.compose/draft.review and artifact.document/artifact.spreadsheet/artifact.presentation/artifact.email/artifact.meeting steps with persisted call/input/attempt/deadline limits. The final step must depend on every other step. Optional decision asks the run owner one question after its dependencies. Use when_choice to select steps, and leave the final step unconditional. Instructions never execute arbitrary tools. The optional procedure records when to use a workflow and its ordered human-owned tasks. Show all steps, the procedure and audience before publication.","inputSchema":{"$defs":{"ExecutionPlan":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"decision":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/PlanDecision"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"max_attempts_per_step":{"default":2,"maximum":3,"minimum":1,"title":"Max Attempts Per Step","type":"integer"},"max_execution_seconds":{"default":3600,"maximum":86400,"minimum":1,"title":"Max Execution Seconds","type":"integer"},"max_generation_calls":{"default":12,"maximum":24,"minimum":1,"title":"Max Generation Calls","type":"integer"},"max_total_input_chars":{"default":200000,"maximum":400000,"minimum":1,"title":"Max Total Input Chars","type":"integer"},"steps":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/PlanStep"},"maxItems":8,"minItems":1,"title":"Steps","type":"array"}},"required":["steps"],"title":"ExecutionPlan","type":"object"},"HumanTask":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"owner":{"maxLength":160,"minLength":1,"title":"Owner","type":"string"},"task":{"maxLength":1000,"minLength":1,"title":"Task","type":"string"}},"required":["owner","task"],"title":